  "notes": "Drafted by tools/draft_server_descriptors.py from providers/form_contracts.py server.define for apache-ignite-native. Field ids are the registration contract's own; backend_field_id is the servers API key (cde_route_<id> / cde_secret_<id> for contract fields). Review tab/group placement."
